    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`deapNode1` is a local DEAP node module under `deapServer`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this node for node-scoped data pipeline configuration and activation. Server-wide topology belongs in `deapServer`, and data behavior belongs in DEAP modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Node settings should remain explicit, observable, and safe to rebalance across sibling nodes."
    }
  ],
